{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216130","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721613001:1":{"text":"분대장님! 근위대원 마틴, 보고드립니다!","source_cn":"队长！守备军马丁报告！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C9B1DF9424847CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721613002:1":{"text":"무슨 일이지?","source_cn":"什么事？<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4A82C2996DB4982","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721613003:1":{"text":"사령관님의 부관이 보낸 물건입니다. 분대장님께 직접 전하라고 하셨습니다!","source_cn":"队长！这是司令的副官送来的，指名要亲手交给您！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC421C8ECC296A51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:4::0":{"text":"벨벳 트랩 초대장","source_cn":"丝绒陷阱邀请函","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7DF81D2D168F9C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721613004:0":{"text":"귀네스는 봉투를 열고 은은한 향이 나는 초대장을 꺼냈다. 매우 고급스러운 재질의 초대장에는 우아한 필기체로 <style=\"highlight\">벨벳 트랩</style>이라는 식당 이름이 적혀 있었다.","source_cn":"格温妮丝打开信封，抽出了一张散发着香薰味道的邀请函。邀...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EFF5A93D5AAEE74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721613005:1":{"text":"벨벳 트랩? 여긴 상층 지구에서 가장 예약하기 힘든 곳이잖아. 그리고 아버지는 이렇게 화려한 곳을 좋아하지 않으시는데.","source_cn":"丝绒陷阱？这可是上城区很难预约的高级餐厅，父亲从来不喜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1CAA3E6241C27A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721613006:1":{"text":"사령관님께서 직접 예약하신 자리라고 합니다! 내일 함께 식사하자며 초대하셨어요.","source_cn":"副官大人说了，这是司令特意订的位置！说是明天诚邀您一同就餐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4514B2EFD945BF82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721613007:1":{"text":"헤헤, 분대장님. 혹시 사령관님이 화해하자는 것 아닐까요? 그날 일도 있었으니... 흠흠.","source_cn":"嘿嘿，队长，看来司令大人是想跟您和好了！毕竟那天……咳咳……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x802ED0E543CCB65D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721613008:1":{"text":"사과? 아니면... 드디어 진실을 알려주시려는 걸까?","source_cn":"他是想道歉吗？还是……终于打算告诉我一些真相了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48CE829FE3A683F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721613009:1":{"text":"마틴, 내일 근무표 좀 확인해 줘.","source_cn":"马丁，确认一下明天的排班表。我有任务吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A89371DC3EA5FA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721613010:1":{"text":"당연히 확인했죠! 내일은 휴무이시니 마음 놓고 다녀오시죠!","source_cn":"早查过了！明天您轮休！您就放心地去赴约吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4041172BE6E868F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721613011:1":{"text":"...그래, 적어도 무슨 이야기를 하시려는 건지 들어봐야겠어.","source_cn":"……好吧，我会去的，至少，先听听他想说什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x409D365EFC1E5F93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:守备军马丁":{"text":"근위대원 마틴","source":"守备军马丁","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}